'smiles-to-get-your-attention':['Smile back when baby starts, then pause so they can keep it going.',['expression']],
'chuckles-during-play':['Repeat the gentle funny face baby enjoys. Pause when they look away.',['peek-face','expression']],
'uses-sounds-or-movement-to-keep-your-attention':['Answer when baby calls you back, then pause for their next turn.',['sound-answer','sock-puppet']],
'coos':['Copy a coo, then listen instead of filling the pause.',['sound-answer','sock-puppet']],
'makes-sounds-back-to-you':['Say a few words, then stop and wait for baby’s reply.',['sound-answer','sock-puppet']],
'turns-toward-your-voice':['Talk softly from nearby to one side and give baby time to find you.',['sound-side']],
'opens-for-breast-or-bottle-when-hungry':['Notice early hunger signals during your usual feeds, rather than waiting for crying.',[]],
'studies-their-hands':['Leave baby’s hands free during awake play so they can find them.',[]],
'keeps-head-steady-while-held':['Hold baby securely with the head support they still need while you talk together.',[]],
