'gets-into-sitting':['Give baby supervised floor space and reachable toys to explore changes of position themselves.',['movement-route']],
'passes-objects-between-hands':['Offer one light toy in front of baby and give them time to turn it and change hands.',['two-hands']],
'rakes-food-with-fingers':['During seated, supervised meals, offer safely prepared food baby can explore with their fingers.',[]],
'sits-without-support':['Stay within reach during floor play and offer a toy baby can hold with both hands.',['bang-two']],
'joins-games-like-pat-a-cake':['Clap along to a familiar song and copy whatever part baby does.',['gesture-song','action-book']],
'waves-goodbye':['Wave at real hellos and goodbyes, and give baby time to join in.',['hello-wave','gesture-song']],
'uses-a-name-for-a-parent':['Use family names in everyday talk, and answer when baby calls for you.',['family-photos']],
'pauses-or-stops-at-no':['For an unsafe action, use a brief clear stop, then redirect baby toward what they can do.',[]],
'puts-an-object-in-a-container':['Drop a large baby-safe block into a bowl, then hand baby one to try.',['put-in','two-baskets']],
'looks-for-something-you-hide':['Hide a large toy under a cloth while baby watches. Leave a corner showing at first.',['hidden-toy','hide-helper','loose-lid']],
